  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll FAQs\n\n### New integration with pension providers\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 25 May, 2022 at  2:33 PM\n\n\t\tAs of 25.05.2022 Capium have further expanded the list of integrations with pension providers. Below are the new pension providers we now integrate with:\n\n- Aegon\n\n- Cushion\n\n- Creative Pension Trust\n- Legal and general\n\n- Royal London\n\n- Salvus\n\n- Scottish Widows\n\n- Simply\n\n- Workers Pension trust\n\n- Options\n\nRefer to the article below to learn how to set up auto enrolment in payroll.\n\nHow to Add the Pension Scheme from the Auto Enrolment section?\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188558\">Payroll FAQs</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">New integration with pension providers\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 25 May, 2022 at  2:33 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">As of 25.05.2022 Capium have further expanded the list of integrations with pension providers. Below are the new pension providers we now integrate with:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br>- Aegon</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Cushion</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Creative Pension Trust<br>- Legal and general</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Royal London</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Salvus</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Scottish Widows</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Simply</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Workers Pension trust</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">- Options</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Refer to the article below to learn how to set up auto enrolment in payroll.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initia